## SQ-SHB-08 | Lured catch, then release: the animal walks out, the trap drops with 7 of 8 uses (SHB-21, SHB-22)
@group A
@commands Bot 10 blocks off; trap facing north; a chicken 4 blocks from it; 20 s; read the trap; the bot right-clicks it
@pass The trap is `triggered=true` with `CaughtEntity` `minecraft:chicken` and no chicken left outside; after the use the block is gone, a chicken stands north of it and an item `rabbit_trap` with `TrapDamage: 1` lies there
@fails Chicken never walks in (navigation target inside the block); caught while the bot is 70 blocks off; the chicken lost on release (UUID clash); the trap drops with no damage or vanishes
@absent farmingforblockheads:rabbit_trap (registered 2026-11-25, after the last /dumpall)
